(7737293, 1275432, 115247, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast but the subject is lacking in interest. Hoping for more small details</td>', 'Nice contrast but the subject is lacking in interest. Hoping for more small details', '2023-01-26 21:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7737296, 1275577, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, the dearest moments, do they shimmer forever or add to the subtle patchwork?  Wonderful portrait of them both.  The emotion, the tones, lighting, composition, everything.  All superbly handled.  The touch of grain is light and deft, almost inevitable.  An heirloom.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Yes, the dearest moments, do they shimmer forever or add to the subtle patchwork?  Wonderful portrait of them both.  The emotion, the tones, lighting, composition, everything.  All superbly handled.  The touch of grain is light and deft, almost inevitable.  An heirloom.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-01-26 23:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7737297, 1275432, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully set out.  Fine disposition of light and, hand in hand, tones.  Fetching composition.  I love the diagonal slash of the draped fabric.  The grain itself is a statement, dusting the image with glitter, but not meant in an easy, flashy way.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully set out.  Fine disposition of light and, hand in hand, tones.  Fetching composition.  I love the diagonal slash of the draped fabric.  The grain itself is a statement, dusting the image with glitter, but not meant in an easy, flashy way.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2023-01-26 23:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
