(7737300, 1275563, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quiet and graceful, bespeaking aristocratic restraint, until the background picture collapses the facade and winks.  Now playfulness comes to the fore, and its import is so much more interesting.  Lovely control of the light, and a nice amount of grain.</td>', 'Quiet and graceful, bespeaking aristocratic restraint, until the background picture collapses the facade and winks.  Now playfulness comes to the fore, and its import is so much more interesting.  Lovely control of the light, and a nice amount of grain.', '2023-01-26 23:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
