(7737303, 1275606, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much, but don''t really see the grain.  Otherwise I would have given it a higher rating.  Both peaceful and jarring, it stays the course.</td>', 'I like this photo very much, but don''t really see the grain.  Otherwise I would have given it a higher rating.  Both peaceful and jarring, it stays the course.', '2023-01-26 23:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7737307, 1275531, 173844, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar, but this new treatment is also winning.  The sky, water and ship are all lent character by the addition of the grain.  The  grain also contributes to the mood.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Looks familiar, but this new treatment is also winning.  The sky, water and ship are all lent character by the addition of the grain.  The  grain also contributes to the mood.  Nicely done.', '2023-01-27 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7737308, 1275577, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well done, Roz!</td>', 'Well done, Roz!', '2023-01-27 00:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7737309, 1275603, 173844, '<td valign="top">Works for me, not knowing what''s going on but yet quite evocative.  If I had to make a stab at interpreting the image I''d say it''s an image of your childhood school and the evil principal, or maybe springtime in the gulag.  In any case, bravo for experimentation and creativity.</td>', 'Works for me, not knowing what''s going on but yet quite evocative.  If I had to make a stab at interpreting the image I''d say it''s an image of your childhood school and the evil principal, or maybe springtime in the gulag.  In any case, bravo for experimentation and creativity.', '2023-01-27 00:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
