(7737313, 1275604, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sweet, kind of high key portrait.  This child knows way more than we understand.  I wouldn''t quibble with the photographer about the amount of grain, but it looks sandy enough to hope he or she doesn''t harm his or her teeth in the eating of the food.  Tender touch.</td>', 'Sweet, kind of high key portrait.  This child knows way more than we understand.  I wouldn''t quibble with the photographer about the amount of grain, but it looks sandy enough to hope he or she doesn''t harm his or her teeth in the eating of the food.  Tender touch.', '2023-01-27 00:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
