(7737365, 1275444, 29535, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the kind comments! This was an unusual one for me, something I don''t usually take but once I got it home into Lightroom it seemed to be perfect for the challenge. I think the grain really adds something to these old Italian streets.<br/> <br/>Thank you for the high votes! I''m very happy with this finish.</td>', 'Thank you for the kind comments! This was an unusual one for me, something I don''t usually take but once I got it home into Lightroom it seemed to be perfect for the challenge. I think the grain really adds something to these old Italian streets. Thank you for the high votes! I''m very happy with this finish.', '2023-01-27 14:22:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7737374, 1275563, 75585, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue!  This is a wonderful set up and fits the topic of grain perfectly . . . Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue!  This is a wonderful set up and fits the topic of grain perfectly . . . Well done!', '2023-01-27 15:27:34.000000', NULL, 0),
